  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.13 - AM041 duplicate type label precision\n\n            Changed:\n            - Hardened AM041 duplicate-map diagnostics to preserve constructed generic type arguments and array ranks\n            - Added AM041 regression coverage for generic collection, one-dimensional array, and multidimensional array duplicate labels\n            - Updated docs, health notes, and release metadata for AM041 diagnostic label precision\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 with targeted AM041 coverage\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.12 - AM030 and AM021 precision hardening",
